00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.112
cuz they got the social media.

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:29.699
They got the NFTs. They just, they got it all.

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:33.286
Fashion and the NFTs, I think, it's a place where

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:35.246
you can be creative and, you know,

00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:38.374
really make what you really want.

00:07:38.374 --> 00:07:42.837
You know, I think it give, it give

00:07:42.837 --> 00:07:45.006
the fans a chance to get something personal

00:07:45.006 --> 00:07:47.800
from you, you know? Your personal shoe

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:52.221
or your personal NFT, T-shirt or whatever you make.

00:07:53.097 --> 00:07:54.098
And that's just for them.

00:07:54.098 --> 00:07:59.103
So, I think that's why it's boomin' right now.

00:07:59.896 --> 00:08:02.648
The next 25, I think it's in good hands.

00:08:03.858 --> 00:08:05.234
